<title>GREECE: NATL BANK OF GREECE OPENS SOFIA BRANCH.</title>
<headline>NATL BANK OF GREECE OPENS SOFIA BRANCH.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>State National Bank of Greece said on Tuesday its new branch in Sofia, Bulgaria opened for business at 5 Triaditsa street.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
